## ObjectType: FX Rate

Dated synthetic USD-per-source-unit conversion curve; prior published weekday fixing is carried to a weekend snapshot, never described as a weekend transaction.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| fx_id | Fx Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | fx_id |
| as_of_date | As Of Date | date | Business snapshot date, distinct from quote/fixing date and date of knowledge. | as_of_date |
| from_currency | From Currency | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | from_currency |
| to_currency | To Currency | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | to_currency |
| rate | Rate | decimal | USD per one source-currency unit; multiply local amount by this value. USD/USD must be 1. | rate |
| published_date | Published Date | date | Business publication/fixing date; actual data must have been published before consumption. | published_date |
| view_kind | View Kind | string | actual is a synthetic observed fact; planned is an explicit forecast known at the observation date, never actual future completion. Allowed values: actual, planned. | view_kind |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: fx_id
